* Lab 4 講義問題 1、2：訊號源內阻 Rs 對兩種組態增益的影響
* 反相：Rs 與 R1 串聯一起參與分壓；非反相：Rs 幾乎不影響
.param RS=1k
VP   vcc 0 DC 15
VN   vee 0 DC -15
VS   vs 0 DC 0 AC 1
RSI  vs vinI {RS}
RSN  vs vinN {RS}
* --- 反相組態 ---
XUI  0 inmI vcc vee voI uA741
R1I  vinI inmI 100k
R2I  voI  inmI 200k
RLI  voI 0 10k
* --- 非反相組態 ---
XUN  vinN inmN vcc vee voN uA741
R1N  inmN 0 100k
R2N  voN inmN 200k
RLN  voN 0 10k
.step param RS list 1m 1k 10k 100k
.ac dec 20 100 100k
.meas ac av_inv FIND mag(V(voI)) AT=1k
.meas ac av_non FIND mag(V(voN)) AT=1k
.end
